### Create Book
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/inventory/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Alicia en el pais",
  "autor": "Lewis Carrol",
  "cantidad": 20,
  "portada_url": "https://images.cdn1.buscalibre.com",
  "anio": 2016,
  "editorial": "Edelvives",
  "genero": "Misterio",
  "sistema_dewey": "109",
  "ubicacion": "Estanteria 2"
}
### Delete book
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/inventory/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Alicia en el pais"
}
### Show catalog 
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/catalog/
Content-Type: application/json

### Year filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/catalog/year/2016
Content-Type: application/json

### Name filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/catalog/name/ALICIA%20en%20el%20pais
Content-Type: application/json

### Gender filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/catalog/gender/misterio
Content-Type: application/json

### Author filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/catalog/author/Lewis%20Carrol
Content-Type: application/json

### Editorial filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/catalog/editorial/edelvives
Content-Type: application/json
